<h3 class="help first">What this tool does</h3>
<p class="help">Automatically resolves album/track credits from <span style="font-weight:bold; color:var(--mf-gold);">MusicBrainz + Discogs</span>, falling back to AI Web Search when thin (its own grounded search already sweeps up Wikipedia/AllMusic/independent sources), with manual Wikipedia search and AllMusic paste both always available for your own follow-up. Review and edit the staged mapping before committing to the MetaForge relationship graph.</p>

